/godot/blob/44c3f6a55a50dbbe884a668c522ad047768c0294/scene/3d/remote_transform_3d.cpp#L72-L99\n\nSo not sure why this would break anything. Please update MRP.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593017680/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593419507","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113363#issuecomment-3593419507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113363","id":3593419507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WLzrz","user":{"login":"angelrwu","id":44008675,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDA4Njc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44008675?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu","html_url":"https://github.com/angelrwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelrwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T21:15:55Z","updated_at":"2025-12-01T00:54:30Z","body":"Added the MRP: \n[gd-remote-transform-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23842160/gd-remote-transform-bug.zip)\n\"WASD\" is movement, \"E\" is swap between character controller, and \"Esc\" is mouse capture mode toggle